# Manifold level 5
# The watcher (stage 3d): the light is the simulation's. A dark hall, four pools of light, a low fog
# bank and an eye at the far end that looks down the hall with that light: walking into a pool, it
# sees you; into the dark, behind the pillar or into the fog, it loses you. One lamp has a switch, and
# one breaks (stage 3e): the phase's demonstration.
title The watcher
spawn 0 1 10
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.08

# The hall: 12 m wide, 24 long.
box 0 -0.5 0      6 0.5 12      color #6f6a62  name floor

# The watcher, on a post at the far end, looking down the hall: it sees 24 m, 70° across, what looks
# lit 0.35 or more.
box 0 1 -11       0.3 1 0.3     color #4a4440
watcher 0 2.4 -11  24 70 0.35  rotate y 180  name eye

# A pool on the left, near the start, from a lamp on a post at chest height (stage 3e): a ball thrown
# at it (F) breaks it, its light goes out, and the eye that saw you there loses you.
lamp -4 1.5 2     4 1           breaks 0.3  model dojo.lamp  name lamp_near
box -4 0.66 2     0.06 0.66 0.06  color #4a4440

# A pool on the right, past the middle, on a switch: the post on the left by the start, E in front of it.
lamp 3 3 -3       4 1           signal switch  name lamp_switch
box -5.4 1 7      0.3 1 0.3     color #4a4440
box -5.4 1.2 6.68  0.12 0.12 0.02  color #c04040
sensor button     -5.4 0.9 6.2  0.6 0.9 0.5  name switch_button
signal pressed    used switch_button
signal switch     toggle pressed

# A pool on the left, past the middle, and a pillar at its far edge: right behind the pillar, lit, the
# eye does not see you; a step aside, it does.
lamp -3.5 3 -4    5 1.2         name lamp_pillar
box -2.4 1.25 -6.6  0.4 1.25 0.4  color #5a544c

# A pool on the right by the start, and a low fog bank in it, 1.2 m high: beside it, lit, the eye sees
# you; in it, the fog takes a third of the lamp's light on its way to you, and the eye sees a third of
# what is left.
lamp 3.5 3 5      4.5 1         name lamp_fog
sensor fog        3.5 0.6 5     1.5 0.6 1.5  opacity 1.5  name fog

# What the eye sees, as a signal (phase 4's guard will raise an alarm with it).
signal spotted    seen eye

# The void around the hall.
sensor fall       0 -6 0        30 3 30
